DG ⟂ AC [04]

 * Auxiliary Constructions:
: Points


 * Proof steps:
001. B,A,F are collinear [01] & A,C,G are collinear [03] & DG ⟂ AC [04] & DF ⟂ AB [02] ⇒  ∠DFA = ∠DGA [05]
002. ∠DFA = ∠DGA [05] ⇒  D,A,F,G are concyclic [06]
003. D,A,F,G are concyclic [06] ⇒  ∠DAG = ∠DFG [07]
004. ∠BAE = ∠DAC [00] & ∠DAG = ∠DFG [07] & A,C,G are collinear [03] ⇒  ∠DFG = ∠BAE [08]
005. ∠DFG = ∠BAE [08] & DF ⟂ AB [02] ⇒  AE ⟂ FG
